.widget_preview/

# AI agent tooling installed into the working copy. Local to whoever installed
# it, not part of the project — LEV's own agent instructions live in CLAUDE.md.
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# The GGUF weights (technical-decisions #19). Hundreds of megabytes of binary
# that git cannot diff and every clone would pay for again. The manifest at
# assets/models/models.json is the source of truth — it names the file and
# pins its sha256, and `dart run tool/fetch_model.dart` fetches and verifies it.
assets/models/*.gguf
